Subject: [PATCH] feat(hamali): add HAMALI viewer role with read-only work home
 screen

- Add HAMALI_VIEW and HAMALI_WORK_MANAGE permissions with backend aliases
- Register hamali module in menu, navigation guard, and bottom nav
- HAMALI role lands on hamali home (Home + More tabs only)
- New feature/hamali package: API, repository, HamaliHomeScreen with daily/week/month tabs
- Dashboard quick action, EN/TE strings, RoleLabels, unit tests
